    "$comment": "Transcription of IDM 'IDM Navigator mit Modbus TCP' for Navigator 1.0 and 1.7, 812049 Rev.1 (parameter list dated 13.06.2016, software from N1.7v / N1.7MLg). A separate register family: input registers (function code 04) from 1000 and 1500, holding registers (03/06) from 2000. Facts only. IDs follow Xerolux/idm-heatpump-api (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Basti). The PV supplement (74-82, 4122) is not in this document: it is 'community' (Xerolux, IDM support supplement after 2016). The coil block (3000-3003, function codes 01/05) is not part of this register file: the adapter has no coil support yet. Untested on a real Navigator 1.x.",
